  "title": "MySQL: Try to handle converstations w/o caps",
  "description": "If the server greeting and login packets weren't part of the captured packets we assume various capabilities were not set. This MR tries to make a better guess in those cases to allow dissection to work in most cases.\n\nExample packets, use \"Decode as...\" to decode port 8032 as MySQL\n\n[mysql2.pcap](/uploads/4da76a7ba41ecdd1dcc68ff4977933b8/mysql2.pcap)",
